  "title": "Vertiv Introduces Family of Commercial-Grade Open Source Management Firmware Solutions",
  "summary": "Vertiv today introduced the Avocent® Core Insight family of embedded management firmware solutions, which allows developers to build applications to help IT and Network administrators deploy, monitor, and provide secure remote management to hardware such as servers, network, storage and IoT devices. The Avocent Core Insight embedded Linux packages include a commercial-ready implementation of the OpenBMC open-source project for baseboard management controllers (BMCs) to simplify development. The family of solutions is available now worldwide.",
